  "title": "Emotion Recognition in Signers",
  "summary": "Both reports highlight challenges in emotion recognition for signers, including overlapping expressions and data scarcity, and propose solutions using datasets like eJSL and BOBSL. They demonstrate improvements in text-based recognition, temporal segment selection, and hand motion integration.",
